msgid "MAME Names"
msgstr "MAME Names"

#: templates/mame_names.html:37
msgid ""
"MAME finds a game by its exact file name, so the files must keep their "
"short names, such as dyger.zip. This tool leaves the files alone and "
"gives each game its real name, year and maker from MAME's own list. A "
"scrape then finds the game by its file name or its real name."
msgstr ""
"I-MAME ifumana umdlalo ngegama lefayile elichanekileyo, ngoko iifayile "
"kufuneka zigcine amagama azo amafutshane, afana ne-dyger.zip. Eli sixhobo"
" asichukumisi iifayile kodwa sinika umdlalo ngamnye igama lawo "
"lokwenyani, unyaka nomenzi ukusuka kuluhlu lwe-MAME ngokwayo. Ukukhupha "
"kuya kuwufumana umdlalo ngegama lefayile okanye ngegama lawo lokwenyani."

#: templates/mame_names.html:38
msgid ""
"A title you changed yourself is kept. A new name is protected from "
"scrapers and the AI. Run this again after adding more MAME games."
msgstr ""
"Isihloko ositshintshe wena sigcinwa. Igama elitsha likhuselwe kwizikhupha"
" nakwi-AI. Phinda usebenzise oku emva kokongeza eminye imidlalo ye-MAME."

#: templates/mame_names.html:41
msgid "MAME list"
msgstr "Uluhlu lwe-MAME"

#: templates/mame_names.html:46
msgid ""
"The DAT that matches your ROMs, or the output of mame -listxml. An .xml "
"file, or a .zip holding one."
msgstr ""
"I-DAT ehambelana ne-ROM zakho, okanye iziphumo ze-mame -listxml. Ifayile "
"ye-.xml, okanye i-.zip equlathe enye."

#: templates/mame_names.html:49
msgid "Second MAME list (optional)"
msgstr "Uluhlu lwesibini lwe-MAME (ukuzikhethela)"

#: templates/mame_names.html:54
msgid ""
"Fills what the first list lacks. BIOS sets are hidden only if a list "
"marks them."
msgstr ""
"Lugcwalisa oko uluhlu lokuqala lungenako. Iseti ze-BIOS zifihlwa kuphela "
"ukuba uluhlu luzichaza."

